%% purpose: Show the supported installation, setup, usage, and recovery path
%% owner: rustdsh maintainers
%% sources: install.sh, src/main.rs, src/setup_web.rs, dashboard/cli.mjs
%% update_triggers: CLI commands, extra gates, setup behavior, or launch platforms change
%% last_verified: 2026-10-08
flowchart TD
    Install["rdshを導入"]
    Check["版とdoctorで導入確認"]
    Setup["setup --webで接続・Extrasを設定"]
    Purpose{"何をしたいか"}
    Chat["tui / webで本家DSHへ委譲"]
    Response["選択したモデルの応答を確認"]
    Native["tokens / search / prune"]
    Local["serveを有効化して状態画面を開く"]
    Project["Node dashboardでプロジェクトを開く"]
    Broken["設定破損で停止"]
    Backup["元の設定を退避・確認"]
    Reset["明示的にinit --forceで既定値へ復旧"]
    Verify["設定とdenyルールを再確認"]
    Install --> Check
    Check --> Setup
    Setup --> Purpose
    Purpose --> Chat
    Chat --> Response
    Purpose --> Native
    Purpose --> Local
    Purpose --> Project
    Check --> Broken
    Broken --> Backup
    Backup --> Reset
    Reset --> Verify
    Verify --> Setup
